<h1>The Tech: Plentiful</h1>
<p>By Sample Student|Group Topic:Food Access</p>
<h2>What is the technology?</h2>
<p>Plentiful is a free tool that lets people reserve a time to pick up food at a food pantry.Instead of waiting in a long line for hours,families get a time slot.</p>
<h3>How does it work?</h3>
<img src="https://www.andoverconnecticut.org/sites/g/files/vyhlif5346/f/resize/imce/foodpantry_0-300x203.jpg" alt="Food Pantry"/>
<ol>
    <li>Open the app or send a text message.</li>
    <li>Pick a food pantry near you.</li>
    <li>Choose a time to pick up food.</li>
    <li>Show up at your time.No long line!.</li>
</ol>
<h4>Facts I found</h4>
<ul>
    <li>It works on any phone that can send a text.</li>
    <li>It works in nine languages.</li>
    <li>Pantries can send group texts when their schedule changes.</li>
</ul>
